The query texts in this directory (queries.jsonl, and the descriptions in image-media.json, dataset.json and licenses.json) are excerpts of Wikimedia Commons file description pages, whose text is licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International License (CC BY-SA 4.0): https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/ (descriptions copied from public-domain sources, such as US government captions, are public domain).

They are distributed under CC BY-SA 4.0, not under the repository's MIT OR Apache-2.0. Attribution: the contributors of each file's description page, linked per file as `source` in dataset.json. Changes made: HTML entities unescaped, tags removed, whitespace collapsed, and text longer than 300 characters cut at the last space (select_eg2_retrieval.py). The images themselves are not in this directory; each is referenced by URL and SHA-256 under its own license (licenses.json, SOURCE.md, model-pipeline/THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md).
